This week is ⁧פרשת דברים⁩ which is ⁧שבת חזון⁩. Before we start, I want to
just wish Dovid Bennett#metadata(none) <person-index-dovid-bennett-684> a ⁧מזל טוב⁩ on his birthday, and I hope you lein
